<?xml version="1.0"?>
<ScenContainer xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xmlns:xsd="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema">
  <ScenTitle>Falkland War, 1982</ScenTitle>
  <ScenDescription>&lt;BODY scroll=auto&gt;&lt;P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;&lt;FONT color=#0b0080 face=Arial&gt;&lt;U&gt;&lt;/U&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&lt;U&gt;&lt;FONT color=#0b0080 face=Arial&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/U&gt;&amp;nbsp;
&lt;P&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;23/04/1982&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;The Falklands war is running. You are commander of the Hermes Taskforce a landing Taskforce and some Victor tanker some Nimrod patrol planes and Vulcan bombers.&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;Try to reach the landing zone for the mariners whith your landing Force. The landing zone are the locked ref. points on the east of the falklands.&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;Try to destroy all enemy forces and airbases also on the mainland of Argentina.&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;The big planes like the Nimrod and Vulcan are based on a small island in the South Atlantic. The name of the island is Ascension Island.&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;&lt;FONT color=#0b0080 face=Arial&gt;&lt;FONT color=#000000 face="Times New Roman"&gt;I don´t know nothing about some subs of the enemy. &lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;You can also drop SAS commando's whit 4 Sea King helicopters. They are on the Hermes Taskforce. You can drop them on the eastern island. With each helicopter can drop 1 time.&lt;/P&gt;&lt;/BODY&gt;</ScenDescription>
